OL,3,CTwo arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter woman found dead in hotel
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of murder after a woman
OL,8,Fwas found dead at a hotel.
OL,10,FMerseyside Police were called to a
OL,11,Fhotel on James Street, Liverpool City
OL,12,FCentre by North West Ambulance Service
OL,13,Fjust after 3.20am on Saturday, 1
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FParamedics attended a report that a 40-
OL,17,Fyear-old woman had become unwell and
OL,18,Fshe was pronounced dead on the scene.
OL,19,FHer death is being treated as
OL,20,Funexplained.
