OL,3,CTwo arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter woman found dead in hotel
OL,6,FAs part of ongoing enquiries, a 47-
OL,7,Fyear-old man from Kirby and a 34-year-
OL,8,Fold woman from Liverpool have been
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,11,FA woman, 31, was also arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of assisting an offencer.
OL,14,FAll three have been conditionally
OL,15,Fbailed while enquiries are ongoing.
OL,17,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,18,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,19,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,20,Four region.
